== Truth Question
  setting: The Desktop
  cast: Trabolta

if Night.truth_n >= 1 and Night.truth_n <= 17:
  match Night.truth_n:
    1:
      Trabolta: What is the name of the first person you kissed?
    2:
      Trabolta: What is something you’re afraid of?
    3:
      Trabolta: What is love?
    4:
      Trabolta: What colour are your underwear?
    5:
      Trabolta: What is the last lie you told, and who believed it?
    6:
      Trabolta: What is the most embarrassing thing in your search history
    7:
      Trabolta: Who in this room would you trust with your password?
    8:
      Trabolta: What is the worst thing you have ever done to a computer?
    9:
      Trabolta: What did you really leave behind at the door?
    10:
      Trabolta: What secret are you keeping from some program inside this computer right now?
    11:
      Trabolta: What was your very first screen name, and who picked it?
    12:
      Trabolta: What is the most money you have lost in one night?
    13:
      Trabolta: Which program in this room are you most suspicious of, and why?
    14:
      Trabolta: Which program do you most admire, and why?
    15:
      Trabolta: What is one thing you have never told your mother?
    16:
      Trabolta: Have you ever been dumped by text? What did it say?
    17:
      Trabolta: What is the cheesiest pickup line that has ever worked on you?
else:
  Trabolta: I have no more questions. Answer the last one again.

