  code: COMPUTER-PROM
  secret: true
  text:
    A ticket, a little crumpled, pink and silver: COMPUTER PROM, HALLOWEEN
    2026. ADMIT TWO: GROK + SANDY. On the back, in a confident hand: "she
    said yes. of course she said yes. everyone says yes to me."
    ▒ HUNT ANSWER F2 ▒
